        Construyo software de calidad, hecho a medida.
      </h1>

      <p
        class="hero-rise mt-5 min-h-[4.5rem] max-w-2xl text-xl font-medium leading-relaxed text-muted sm:min-h-[3rem] sm:text-2xl"
        style="--delay: 160ms"
      >
        Abierto a roles de{" "}
        <span class="text-accent" data-typewriter aria-hidden="true"></span><span
          class="typewriter-cursor"
          data-typewriter-cursor
          aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="sr-only">
          Desarrollador Full-Stack, Desarrollador Backend, Desarrollador Frontend y QA Funcional
        </span>
      </p>

      <div
        class="hero-rise mt-6 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3"
        style="--delay: 240ms"
      >
        <a
          href="#proyectos"
          class="group inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 rounded-sm bg-accent px-5 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-ink transition-opacity duration-200 hover:opacity-90 motion-reduce:transition-none"
        >
          Ver proyectos
          <svg
            aria-hidden="true"
            viewBox="0 0 14 14"
            class="size-3.5 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1 motion-reduce:transition-none"
          >
            <path
              d={arrow}
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="1.5"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
            />
          </svg>
        </a>

        <a
          href="#contacto"
          class="group inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 rounded-sm border border-line px-5 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-paper transition-colors duration-200 hover:border-paper/40 motion-reduce:transition-none"
        >
          Hablemos
          <svg
            aria-hidden="true"
            viewBox="0 0 14 14"
            class="size-3.5 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1 motion-reduce:transition-none"
          >
            <path
              d={arrow}
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="1.5"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
            />
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>

      <p
        class="hero-rise mt-5 flex items-start gap-3 font-mono text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted"
        style="--delay: 320ms"
      >
        <span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-1.5 size-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-status"></span>
        Disponible para oportunidades laborales.
      </p>
    </div>
    </div>

    <div
      class="hero-rise mt-10 pt-6 lg:absolute lg:inset-x-0 lg:bottom-0 lg:mt-0"
      style="--delay: 420ms"
    >
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 divide-y divide-line sm:grid-cols-3 sm:divide-x sm:divide-y-0">
        <a
          href="mailto:jumanuelro.14@gmail.com"
          class="group flex flex-col gap-1 py-4 transition-colors sm:pr-6"
        >
          <span class="flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.1em] text-muted uppercase">
            <svg
              aria-hidden="true"
              viewBox="0 0 16 16"
              class="size-3.5 text-accent"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="1.5"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
            >
              <rect x="2" y="3" width="12" height="10" rx="1.5" />
              <path d="m2.5 4 5.5 4 5.5-4" />
            </svg>
            Correo
          </span>
          <span class="text-sm text-paper transition-colors group-hover:text-accent">
            jumanuelro.14@gmail.com
          </span>
        </a>

        <a
